{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A pair of jeans is positioned on the top side of the frame, with a sock placed to its left. For every remote present, it is located on the bottom side and aligned vertically with the jeans. Arranged around each remote are three items: a wallet located above the remote, a knife positioned to the left of the remote, and a cup which is aligned vertically with the knife. Additionally, the cup is larger than the wallet.",
